    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Phase 2 A-2: DB Connection Leak (10 gaps) — RAII guards + exception-safe cleanup</para>
</simplesect>
Executes analytical queries with automatic connection lifecycle management using RAII ConnectionGuard pattern. Prevents connection pool exhaustion and resource leaks in normal and exceptional paths.</para>
